185	 * with the player inside its activation radius spawns one hostile on the room
186	 * floor (feet at the spawner's own y, not the surface), bounded by a local
187	 * cluster cap and the shared global HOSTILE_CAP. Time-independent — dungeons
188	 * are dark. Spawner positions come from the session-derived index set, so
